                                                                                                                                               "typeName":  "dsDescriptionValue",
                                                                                                                                               "multiple":  false,
                                                                                                                                               "typeClass":  "primitive",
                                                                                                                                               "value":  "This dataset contains data collected during the 2020 agricultural season in the Lis Valley case study area (Portugal). The experiments were carried out in pilot fields at the Nuno Guilherme pilot farm, testing two irrigation strategies: (i) wet seeding with traditional continuous flooding (WFL) and (ii) wet seeding with alternate wetting and drying (AWD). It also includes data from a surface drip irrigation (DRIP) field tested at the Delfim Eugénio pilot farm. The dataset further provides the experimental field layouts and details of the cultivated rice varieties."
                                                                                                                                           }
                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                            ]
